Subject: Re: Refactoring vectors from std::vector to Eigen::Matrix
Message-ID: <d7BXfZLKMKE.--1KeZMv_9UJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <d7BXfZLKMKE.Qni2Bho860IJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
References: <d7BXfZLKMKE.Qni2Bho860IJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
