References: <d7BXfZLKMKE.Qni2Bho860IJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com> <d7BXfZLKMKE.--1KeZMv_9UJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-dev/c/d7BXfZLKMKE/m/c5Iho6YDZY0J>
