Without additional arguments for refactoring now, I think it's wise to table it. The issue Bob and I were seeing with assigning to blocks of matrices isn't going to work in general and we have a lot of functions where we try to do a lot of different things. We're going to trip on this sooner or later. See:
http://eigen.tuxfamily.org/dox/TopicFunctionTakingEigenTypes.html
See section "In which cases do functions taking a plain Matrix or Array argument fail?"

There is a hack provided as a work-around, but we will need to utilize what's in the note at the end, which states that Block expressions can't be cast as a Matrix reference. That's the case where I was tripped up on Friday.

Daniel

