It's a somewhat hidden feature of GitHub, but you can have a custom landing page for GitHub.  For example, you can render something nice (like Doxygen) at http://betanalpha.github.com/jamon/ but have you repo still at www.github.com/betanalpha/jamon <http://www.github.com/betanalpha/jamon>

If all if this debate about readmes is just about having a nice landing late for users then this might be an option that would allow the repo page to stay clean.

